/ ============================================================================
/ FLEXI ADMIN EXAMPLE: Grid View Template
/ ============================================================================
/ The grid_view block defines card content. Available DSL:
/
/   image  :attr, ...    — card image (expects ActiveStorage attachment)
/   header :attr, ...    — card subtitle (small, muted text above title)
/   title  :attr, ...    — card title (clickable link to show page)
/   description :attr    — card body text
/   quick_action { }     — custom action overlay on card
/
/ Each method accepts:
/   - An attribute name (called on resource)
/   - as: :text/:date formatter
/   - A block for custom rendering (receives resource)
/ ============================================================================

= grid_view do

  / --- Card header (subtitle above title) ---
  - header :role, as: :text

  / --- Card title (becomes a link to show page via navigate_to) ---
  - title :full_name

  / --- Card description ---
  - description :email, as: :text
